Input: {"question": "In which significant event was State of charge estimation device involved?", "source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 104, "text": "**Breaking News: Revolutionary State of Charge Estimation Device Plays Crucial Role in Landmark Filing**"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 106, "end": 313, "text": "In a groundbreaking development, a cutting-edge State of Charge Estimation Device has been instrumental in a significant legal filing, marking a major milestone in the field of energy storage and management."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 314, "end": 477, "text": "According to US Patent 11150306, this innovative device has been at the forefront of a landmark filing, solidifying its position as a game-changer in the industry."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 478, "end": 640, "text": "The State of Charge Estimation Device, designed to accurately determine the remaining capacity of a battery, has been hailed as a crucial component in the filing."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 641, "end": 813, "text": "This device's ability to provide precise and reliable data has enabled companies to optimize their energy storage systems, leading to improved efficiency and reduced costs."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 814, "end": 933, "text": "\"We are thrilled to see our State of Charge Estimation Device play a pivotal role in this significant filing,\" said Dr."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 934, "end": 1017, "text": "Maria Hernandez, Lead Researcher at EnergyTech Inc., the company behind the device."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1018, "end": 1155, "text": "\"Our technology has the potential to revolutionize the way we manage energy storage, and this filing is a testament to its capabilities.\""}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1156, "end": 1246, "text": "Industry experts agree that the State of Charge Estimation Device is a major breakthrough."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1247, "end": 1371, "text": "\"This device has the potential to transform the energy storage landscape,\" said John Smith, CEO of Energy Storage Solutions."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1372, "end": 1543, "text": "\"Its accuracy and reliability will enable companies to make informed decisions about their energy usage, leading to significant cost savings and reduced carbon emissions.\""}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1544, "end": 1730, "text": "Data from the filing reveals that the State of Charge Estimation Device has been instrumental in reducing energy waste by up to 30% and increasing the lifespan of batteries by up to 25%."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1731, "end": 1807, "text": "These figures are a clear indication of the device's impact on the industry."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1808, "end": 1872, "text": "\"The significance of this filing cannot be overstated,\" said Dr."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1873, "end": 1883, "text": "Hernandez."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1884, "end": 2017, "text": "\"It demonstrates the power of innovation in driving progress and highlights the importance of investing in research and development.\""}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2018, "end": 2157, "text": "As the energy storage industry continues to evolve, the State of Charge Estimation Device is poised to play an increasingly important role."}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2158, "end": 2298, "text": "With its proven track record and potential for widespread adoption, this device is set to make a lasting impact on the way we manage energy."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 82, "text": "**HEADLINE:** Revolutionary Battery Tech Pays Respect at Historic Funeral Ceremony"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 84, "end": 194, "text": "**SUBHEADLINE:** State-of-Charge Estimation Device Plays Unlikely Role in Farewell to Beloved Community Leader"}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 196, "end": 402, "text": "In a poignant display of innovation and respect, a cutting-edge state of charge estimation device was unexpectedly involved in the funeral ceremony of beloved community leader, Agnes Thompson, last weekend."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 403, "end": 541, "text": "The device, typically used to monitor battery life in electric vehicles, took center stage at the historic event, leaving mourners in awe."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 542, "end": 603, "text": "The funeral, attended by over 500 people, was held at the St."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 604, "end": 642, "text": "Mary's Church in downtown Los Angeles."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 643, "end": 792, "text": "As the procession began, a sleek, black electric hearse, equipped with the state of charge estimation device, carried Thompson's casket to the altar."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 793, "end": 959, "text": "The device, developed by California-based tech firm, EcoPulse, was integrated into the hearse's battery management system to ensure a seamless and dignified ceremony."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 960, "end": 1023, "text": "\"We were honored to be a part of this special moment,\" said Dr."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1024, "end": 1079, "text": "Rachel Kim, CEO of EcoPulse, in an exclusive interview."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1080, "end": 1208, "text": "\"Our device was designed to optimize battery performance, but we never imagined it would play a role in such a meaningful event."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1209, "end": 1264, "text": "It's a testament to the versatility of our technology.\""}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1265, "end": 1451, "text": "According to sources close to the funeral planning committee, the idea to incorporate the state of charge estimation device was conceived by Thompson's grandson, an engineer at EcoPulse."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1452, "end": 1548, "text": "\"Agnes was always fascinated by innovation and sustainability,\" said Thompson's grandson, James."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1549, "end": 1666, "text": "\"We wanted to celebrate her life in a way that reflected her values, and the device became an integral part of that.\""}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1667, "end": 1819, "text": "As the ceremony progressed, the device ensured the hearse's battery remained at optimal levels, allowing the procession to proceed without interruption."}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1820, "end": 1973, "text": "The device's real-time monitoring capabilities also provided a sense of comfort to the mourners, knowing that every detail had been carefully considered."}, "D2S18": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1974, "end": 2061, "text": "\"It was a beautiful gesture,\" said Reverend Michael Brown, who officiated the ceremony."}, "D2S19": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2062, "end": 2132, "text": "\"The device added a sense of modernity and respect to the proceedings."}, "D2S20": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2133, "end": 2177, "text": "It was a fitting tribute to Agnes's legacy.\""}, "D2S21": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2178, "end": 2327, "text": "Data from the device revealed that the hearse's battery level remained above 80% throughout the ceremony, ensuring a smooth and dignified procession."}, "D2S22": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2328, "end": 2481, "text": "The device's advanced algorithms also enabled the hearse to travel an additional 10 miles on a single charge, reducing the carbon footprint of the event."}}, "candidates": [], "original_cards": [], "initial_answers": ["landmark filing", "historic funeral ceremony"]}
